      <p>The degree gave me a strong engineering foundation, but also a solid grounding in mathematics and physics, and a deeper understanding of reality. It led as well to my first published paper, which you can find in <a href="{{ '/research/' | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">Research</a>.</p>
